  <has_title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">For the best access to the oil drain plug, and for optimal oil drainage, it is recommended that the scooter be stood upright. Always make sure your work area is clean and you have plenty of room to work safely. Never start or run your scooter indoors.</has_title>
